her with your friends in co-op play for 1–4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can take on a different role, share findings, and combine evidence to move the investigation forward. Cooperation and communication are essential to uncovering complex truths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.poster.avif?t=1784132870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.webm?t=1784132870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/extras/6db2ab1ffe699d78cf5283d5af2be877.mp4?t=1784132870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Depth Investigations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use professional tools at the police station to advance your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze CCTV footage, scan DNA traces, access restricted databases, repair distorted audio recordings, and examine forensic and toxicological reports. Perform autopsies, identify causes of death, and uncover critical evidence that can incriminate your suspect. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic and Engaging Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case is built around detailed characters, realistic environments, and carefully written scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover victims’ pasts, explore their homes, search confidential documents, find secret rooms, crack safes, or hack security systems. Expect psychological tension, unexpected twists, and surprising outcomes at the end of each investigation.<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our Discord</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to support development, share feedback, and become part of our growing detective community. </p>", "short_description": "Uncover the truth behind America’s most mysterious murders of the 2000s in a 1–4 player co-op detective experience. Use special equipment to find hidden clues, track suspects in an open world, and interrogate them at the police station.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hindi, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/header.jpg?t=1784132870", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/6b595f93ca00fa3103c285b27a72e8b9d675fdc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784132870", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062170/6b595f93ca00fa3103c285b27a72e8b9d675fdc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784132870", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD FX 4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "ma